				"markdown": "# Video: 00:01.881 => 01:34.050\nWidth: 1920\nHeight: 1080\n\nTranscript\n```\nWEBVTT\n\n00:02.110 --> 00:08.190\n<Speaker 1>Now, recall that this course is called Introduction to Modern Machine Learning and Applications.\n\n00:08.510 --> 00:12.830\n<Speaker 1>In this unit, we will focus on the keyword, machine learning.\n\n00:14.670 --> 00:17.310\n<Speaker 1>Let's start with the definition of machine learning.\n\n00:17.710 --> 00:24.430\n<Speaker 1>From historical or evolutional perspective, machine learning is a subfield of artificial intelligence.\n\n00:24.830 --> 00:32.190\n<Speaker 1>Artificial intelligence means we want to have computers to mimic human intelligence to accomplish tasks for us.\n\n00:33.030 --> 00:44.030\n<Speaker 1>And over the past 10 years, machine learning has become a mainstream approach for artificial intelligence problems because of the rapid improvement in computational power.\n\n00:44.910 --> 00:50.350\n<Speaker 1>From terminology perspective, machine learning means a set of algorithms or\n\n00:51.390 --> 00:57.230\n<Speaker 1>methods that will empower computers to perform tasks without writing single rules.\n\n00:57.630 --> 01:07.470\n<Speaker 1>For example, if you want to teach a computer to distinguish dogs and cats, you will not want to write something like, oh, most dogs' ears are round and so on.\n\n01:07.870 --> 01:14.670\n<Speaker 1>Instead, you might want to collect a lot of pictures of dogs and cats, fit them into a machine learning training pipeline.\n\n01:14.990 --> 01:19.230\n<Speaker 1>This pipeline will identify underlying patterns and build a model.\n\n01:19.790 --> 01:30.990\n<Speaker 1>Then, during the testing time, you can fit a model as well as an unseen new image to ask this model whether this image belongs to a cat or dog.\n\n01:31.710 --> 01:34.510\n<Speaker 1>So that's the general idea about machine learning.\n```\n\nKey Frames\n- 00:01.881 ![](keyFrame.1881.jpg)\n- 00:03.762 ![](keyFrame.3762.jpg)\n- 00:05.643 ![](keyFrame.5643.jpg)\n- 00:07.524 ![](keyFrame.7524.jpg)\n- 00:09.405 ![](keyFrame.9405.jpg)\n- 00:11.286 ![](keyFrame.11286.jpg)\n- 00:13.167 ![](keyFrame.13167.jpg)\n- 00:15.048 ![](keyFrame.15048.jpg)\n- 00:16.929 ![](keyFrame.16929.jpg)\n- 00:18.810 ![](keyFrame.18810.jpg)\n- 00:20.691 ![](keyFrame.20691.jpg)\n- 00:22.572 ![](keyFrame.22572.jpg)\n- 00:24.453 ![](keyFrame.24453.jpg)\n- 00:26.334 ![](keyFrame.26334.jpg)\n- 00:28.215 ![](keyFrame.28215.jpg)\n- 00:30.096 ![](keyFrame.30096.jpg)\n- 00:31.977 ![](keyFrame.31977.jpg)\n- 00:33.858 ![](keyFrame.33858.jpg)\n- 00:35.739 ![](keyFrame.35739.jpg)\n- 00:37.620 ![](keyFrame.37620.jpg)\n- 00:39.501 ![](keyFrame.39501.jpg)\n- 00:41.382 ![](keyFrame.41382.jpg)\n- 00:43.263 ![](keyFrame.43263.jpg)\n- 00:45.144 ![](keyFrame.45144.jpg)\n- 00:47.025 ![](keyFrame.47025.jpg)\n- 00:48.906 ![](keyFrame.48906.jpg)\n- 00:50.787 ![](keyFrame.50787.jpg)\n- 00:52.668 ![](keyFrame.52668.jpg)\n- 00:54.549 ![](keyFrame.54549.jpg)\n- 00:56.430 ![](keyFrame.56430.jpg)\n- 00:58.311 ![](keyFrame.58311.jpg)\n- 01:00.192 ![](keyFrame.60192.jpg)\n- 01:02.073 ![](keyFrame.62073.jpg)\n- 01:03.954 ![](keyFrame.63954.jpg)\n- 01:05.835 ![](keyFrame.65835.jpg)\n- 01:07.716 ![](keyFrame.67716.jpg)\n- 01:09.597 ![](keyFrame.69597.jpg)\n- 01:11.478 ![](keyFrame.71478.jpg)\n- 01:13.359 ![](keyFrame.73359.jpg)\n- 01:15.240 ![](keyFrame.75240.jpg)\n- 01:17.121 ![](keyFrame.77121.jpg)\n- 01:19.002 ![](keyFrame.79002.jpg)\n- 01:20.883 ![](keyFrame.80883.jpg)\n- 01:22.764 ![](keyFrame.82764.jpg)\n- 01:24.645 ![](keyFrame.84645.jpg)\n- 01:26.526 ![](keyFrame.86526.jpg)\n- 01:28.407 ![](keyFrame.88407.jpg)\n- 01:30.288 ![](keyFrame.90288.jpg)\n- 01:32.169 ![](keyFrame.92169.jpg)\n- 01:34.050 ![](keyFrame.94050.jpg)",
